/local/projects/*
!/local/projects/.gitkeep
!/local/projects/*/
/local/projects/*/*
!/local/projects/*/requirements-inbox/
/local/projects/*/requirements-inbox/*
!/local/projects/*/requirements-inbox/README.md
# cg-work 自身是框架受管项目：其上下文、需求包、任务和报告随框架提交，但不得摘录业务项目真实数据。
!/local/projects/cg-work/**
# 本机工具副本可能包含个人路径或运行参数，不进入框架提交。
# 例外：browser-test 浏览器验收测试工具作为框架共用资产入库；凭据、执行证据与业务导出一律排除。
/local/tools/*
!/local/tools/browser-test/
/local/tools/browser-test/**/*.local.json
/local/tools/browser-test/**/runs/
/local/tools/browser-test/**/exports/
/local/tools/browser-test/**/_tmp-*.mjs
node_modules/
/.workbuddy/
/.obsidian/
/.playwright-mcp/
/.trae/
/.codegraph/
